DirkuLator 0.5.12: the task/mesh probe (0.5) arms only with draw-diagnostics.txt and keeps its copies in deferred
staging buffers (0.5.11 crashed at 837 s reading a copy EDEN_STAGING_TRIM had released). EDEN_HOST_CPU logs the JIT's
host features and raw CPUID bits once.

